(7285359, 1135412, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful piece if art.  Composition is perfect.  My favourite in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a beautiful piece if art.  Composition is perfect.  My favourite in the challenge.', '2014-11-14 20:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7285360, 1135112, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is one of those images that makes me stop and think, and appreciate the artist that saw, captures and created this work,  I really like this image.</td>', 'This is one of those images that makes me stop and think, and appreciate the artist that saw, captures and created this work,  I really like this image.', '2014-11-14 20:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7285361, 1135151, 32011, '<td valign="top">Sir Isaac Newton would love this image.  It''s a good subject, given many speculate that purple was split into indigo and violet to give us 7 colours of the rainbow because of Isaac''s superstitious nature. Lucky 7 indeed.</td>', 'Sir Isaac Newton would love this image.  It''s a good subject, given many speculate that purple was split into indigo and violet to give us 7 colours of the rainbow because of Isaac''s superstitious nature. Lucky 7 indeed.', '2014-11-14 20:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7285362, 1135307, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice processing and composition.</td>', 'Nice processing and composition.', '2014-11-14 20:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7285363, 1135160, 32011, '<td valign="top">This one had me looking for the 7... and when I found them, I better appreciated the art of this image.  That''s always a risk with such challenges - people fixate on it meeting the challenge and forget about the art.  Thankfully, my Where''s Wally skills are still with me and I got to enjoy the beauty of this image.  Well done.</td>', 'This one had me looking for the 7... and when I found them, I better appreciated the art of this image.  That''s always a risk with such challenges - people fixate on it meeting the challenge and forget about the art.  Thankfully, my Where''s Wally skills are still with me and I got to enjoy the beauty of this image.  Well done.', '2014-11-14 20:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
