(7286251, 1135415, 13077, '<td valign="top">With the shell that looks like a big smiling mouth, it might have been cute/funny to photoshop a couple of the other shells into a place where they looked like eyes.</td>', 'With the shell that looks like a big smiling mouth, it might have been cute/funny to photoshop a couple of the other shells into a place where they looked like eyes.', '2014-11-19 13:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7286252, 1135443, 13077, '<td valign="top">Simple and eery, but I''m not crazy about the way the reflections look with a big of the wood texture of the surface. Some construction paper might have looked cleaner.</td>', 'Simple and eery, but I''m not crazy about the way the reflections look with a big of the wood texture of the surface. Some construction paper might have looked cleaner.', '2014-11-19 13:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
