(7286522, 1135323, 138630, '<td valign="top">My top pick.  These soldiers would have loved this LOL  Really, the processing is perfect for the period look and the bicycle adds an intriguing touch that for me keeps this group portrait from being too static.  Love the context added by the setting, too.  Voted way earlier.  10<br/>edit to correct typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-11-21 00:04:20.</i></td>', 'My top pick.  These soldiers would have loved this LOL  Really, the processing is perfect for the period look and the bicycle adds an intriguing touch that for me keeps this group portrait from being too static.  Love the context added by the setting, too.  Voted way earlier.  10edit to correct typo', '2014-11-20 11:57:13.000000', '2014-11-21 00:04:20.000000', 1),
(7286523, 1135430, 138630, '<td valign="top">A top pick from me - the depth and tones are fantastic and the attention to detail amazing as always.  Voted way earlier.  9</td>', 'A top pick from me - the depth and tones are fantastic and the attention to detail amazing as always.  Voted way earlier.  9', '2014-11-20 11:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7286528, 1135447, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and the expanse here, probably because the scene is so familiar to me and I find a beauty in the coexistence of these enormous turbines and the endless farmland that surrounds them that many do not.  Not sure about the focus - part of me wants a deeper dof or else a more clearly "misty" mood.  Sky is grainy in a way that does not look intentional and there''s a sensor spot that ought to have been removed.  Still, I do like the feel and it''s a top pick from me.  Voted earlier.  7</td>', 'I like the tones and the expanse here, probably because the scene is so familiar to me and I find a beauty in the coexistence of these enormous turbines and the endless farmland that surrounds them that many do not.  Not sure about the focus - part of me wants a deeper dof or else a more clearly "misty" mood.  Sky is grainy in a way that does not look intentional and there''s a sensor spot that ought to have been removed.  Still, I do like the feel and it''s a top pick from me.  Voted earlier.  7', '2014-11-20 12:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
