(7286612, 1135440, 37858, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the old Minolta I had from my school days.  ...mine was the SRT 200, fully manual, solid build (heavy too), looks cool (subjective, I know)...and the best part...I still own it in pristine condition.  I''m going to have to start using it again.<br/> <br/>O.K.  Enough of my nostalgia.  Your photo is nicely presented.  I love all the dark/black in it.  Nice collection.</td>', 'Reminds me of the old Minolta I had from my school days.  ...mine was the SRT 200, fully manual, solid build (heavy too), looks cool (subjective, I know)...and the best part...I still own it in pristine condition.  I''m going to have to start using it again. O.K.  Enough of my nostalgia.  Your photo is nicely presented.  I love all the dark/black in it.  Nice collection.', '2014-11-20 21:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7286613, 1135429, 37858, '<td valign="top">Nice image, especially with the red flower as I find red somewhat problematic to photograph under some lighting conditions.  Well done.  I''ll bet is scores high.</td>', 'Nice image, especially with the red flower as I find red somewhat problematic to photograph under some lighting conditions.  Well done.  I''ll bet is scores high.', '2014-11-20 21:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
