(7286623, 1135456, 136989, '<td valign="top">I drive by a similar scene every morning.  Every morning I tell myself that some day I need to stop and capture a pick.  I''m glad you did.  :) While I prefer color shots this really works.</td>', 'I drive by a similar scene every morning.  Every morning I tell myself that some day I need to stop and capture a pick.  I''m glad you did.  :) While I prefer color shots this really works.', '2014-11-20 22:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
