(7286629, 1135453, 138630, '<td valign="top">Terrific idea for the challenge - clearly a composite yet the overlapping and the sepia tones unite the pieces in such a way that it all feels of a piece - like a reflection seen in a most unusual city display window.  Great fun to explore and I hope it does well with the masses.  I suspect it will at least resound with a narrow audience and that may be even better. Voted way earlier.  8</td>', 'Terrific idea for the challenge - clearly a composite yet the overlapping and the sepia tones unite the pieces in such a way that it all feels of a piece - like a reflection seen in a most unusual city display window.  Great fun to explore and I hope it does well with the masses.  I suspect it will at least resound with a narrow audience and that may be even better. Voted way earlier.  8', '2014-11-20 22:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
